# Treat CAD files and archives as binary: no line-ending conversion, no textual
# diffs/merges. (STEP/DXF are technically text but are large and machine-generated.)
*.step  binary
*.stp   binary
*.f3z   binary
*.f3d   binary
*.dxf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.z01   binary
*.z02   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
